    "body": "The empty pause menu came from the replacement file format. LML loaded the file, but it was XML; the current game asset is binary RBF, so the game received an empty screen stack. I replaced it with a valid binary RBF file that removes only Online and Social Club and keeps the other ten entries in their original order. The independent parser, byte round-trip, focused contract, and known-bad mutations pass. I did not install it because the build and installation are on hold, so the game still has the old file and this remains actionable.",
